1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:29,980
Master Fitz, not at me.

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:59,980
Master Fitz, not at me.

3
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:29,980
Master Fitz, not at me.

4
00:03:00,030 --> 00:03:04,030
I've been at the University of Magic for about a year.

5
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:06,030
Enough time for me to turn 16.

6
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:09,030
I still begin each day with a workout.

7
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:12,030
Only new thing about that is some added motivation.

8
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:16,030
I never know how to talk to this guy.

9
00:03:16,030 --> 00:03:18,030
Still kind of scared of him.

10
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,030
Tell me.

11
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:20,030
Yeah?

12
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:22,030
Why do you desire strength?

13
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:24,030
I'm not quite sure how to answer that.

14
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:28,030
I've known many men obsessed with the pursuit of strength, fame, and fortune.

15
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:31,030
Not a decent one among them, if you ask me.

16
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:33,030
All narrow-minded.

17
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:36,030
There are more worthwhile things to chase in life.

18
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:38,030
Like what, would you say?

19
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:40,030
Like women, boy!

20
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:43,030
You'll understand once you find one yourself.

21
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:48,030
Speaking of, Your Majesty.

22
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,030
What is it?

23
00:03:49,030 --> 00:03:52,030
Do you happen to know a cure for impotence?

24
00:03:52,030 --> 00:03:54,030
I do not.

25
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:55,030
Hmm.

26
00:03:57,030 --> 00:04:02,030
After a little training, it's time for breakfast, and then on to class.

27
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:03,030
What a pain in the ass.

28
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:05,030
You're telling me, duh.

29
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:07,030
Can you believe this weather?

30
00:04:07,030 --> 00:04:08,030
It's just lovely.

31
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:15,030
Since that duel with Badi Gadi, most of the other students steer clear of me.

32
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:30,030
Come on, you can cut Goliad a little bit of slack, boss.

33
00:04:30,030 --> 00:04:32,030
Her heart's in the right place and everything.

34
00:04:32,030 --> 00:04:36,030
Besides, I'd like it if you tried to make us look good in front of the other beast folk, Meow.

35
00:04:36,030 --> 00:04:41,030
With all the minions that you have at this point, it's gotten tougher being your number two.

36
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:43,030
Hey, Meow, I'm the boss's number two!

37
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:46,030
Now, now, there's no need to argue about it, okay?

38
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:49,030
I consider you both my number two.

39
00:04:49,030 --> 00:04:51,030
Way to miss the point, boss.

40
00:04:51,030 --> 00:04:54,030
We need a clearly defined hierarchy.

41
00:04:54,030 --> 00:04:55,030
Yes, we do.

42
00:04:55,030 --> 00:04:59,030
Like, since you can beat Silent Fits, you can basically run this place.

43
00:04:59,030 --> 00:05:00,030
Me in charge here?

44
00:05:00,030 --> 00:05:01,030
No, thank you.

45
00:05:01,030 --> 00:05:04,030
Now grow a pair and show off your claws, Meow!

46
00:05:04,030 --> 00:05:06,030
Not happening.

47
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:07,030
Hmm.

48
00:05:11,030 --> 00:05:12,030
Brutus.

49
00:05:12,030 --> 00:05:15,030
What all do you know about curses?

50
00:05:15,030 --> 00:05:17,030
A growing interest of his lately.

51
00:05:17,030 --> 00:05:19,030
Curses, huh?

52
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:20,030
Curses.

53
00:05:20,030 --> 00:05:21,030
Curses.

54
00:05:21,030 --> 00:05:26,030
A friend once told me that Laplace transferred his curse to objects,

55
00:05:26,030 --> 00:05:29,030
and that let him force the curse onto others.

56
00:05:29,030 --> 00:05:30,030
That's so.

57
00:05:30,030 --> 00:05:31,030
Hmm?

58
00:05:31,030 --> 00:05:34,030
He cursed the spears he gave the Superd in the Laplace War.

59
00:05:34,030 --> 00:05:35,030
They didn't use their own.

60
00:05:35,030 --> 00:05:41,030
And basically, it caused them to go on a bloody rampage, which led to their whole race being vilified.

61
00:05:41,030 --> 00:05:42,030
Seriously?

62
00:05:42,030 --> 00:05:44,030
That's how that started?

63
00:05:44,030 --> 00:05:45,030
Oh.

64
00:05:45,030 --> 00:05:46,030
Oh.

65
00:05:46,030 --> 00:05:47,030
Uh.

66
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:48,030
Uh.

67
00:05:48,030 --> 00:05:49,030
Sounds like.

68
00:05:49,030 --> 00:05:52,030
Just according to what I heard, at least.

69
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:54,030
Fascinating.

70
00:05:54,030 --> 00:05:56,030
Transferring a curse.

71
00:05:58,030 --> 00:06:00,030
That's very helpful.

72
00:06:00,030 --> 00:06:01,030
Thanks, Rudeus.

73
00:06:01,030 --> 00:06:03,030
I've got an idea on what to do now.

74
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:07,030
After class, it's lunchtime.

75
00:06:10,030 --> 00:06:12,030
How about we grab a seat right here?

76
00:06:12,030 --> 00:06:16,030
Good idea, as Julie wouldn't be able to join us on the third floor.

77
00:06:16,030 --> 00:06:18,030
Hey, that's Rudeus.

78
00:06:18,030 --> 00:06:20,030
Guy's a powerhouse.

79
00:06:20,030 --> 00:06:23,030
Took down every other special student in his first year.

80
00:06:23,030 --> 00:06:24,030
Oh, yeah.

81
00:06:24,030 --> 00:06:27,030
Not to mention one-shotting the Demon King in front of literally everybody.

82
00:06:27,030 --> 00:06:30,030
I don't mind getting my ego stroked, of course.

83
00:06:30,030 --> 00:06:32,030
But I can't let it go to my head.

84
00:06:34,030 --> 00:06:38,030
If it isn't my mighty little friend, all tucked away in a corner.

85
00:06:46,030 --> 00:06:49,030
Master, that thing His Majesty's drinking looks so yummy.

86
00:06:53,030 --> 00:06:55,030
Spoken like a true dwarf.

87
00:06:55,030 --> 00:06:58,030
Incredible that she can discern quality at such a young age.

88
00:06:58,030 --> 00:06:59,030
Yes.

89
00:06:59,030 --> 00:07:02,030
You wouldn't be opposed to sharing a drop or two with us, Your Majesty.

90
00:07:02,030 --> 00:07:04,030
Surely you jest, boy.

91
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:06,030
Few things are less fun than drinking alone.

92
00:07:07,030 --> 00:07:08,030
But don't stop at a drop.

93
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:09,030
Guzzle away!

94
00:07:11,030 --> 00:07:12,030
Yes.

95
00:07:12,030 --> 00:07:14,030
This is not a beverage to be sipped.

96
00:07:14,030 --> 00:07:17,030
Then maybe it'd be better to wait until after class.

97
00:07:21,030 --> 00:07:22,030
That's your wish.

98
00:07:22,030 --> 00:07:23,030
I shall obey.

99
00:07:25,030 --> 00:07:28,030
It's a tough road for you scholars, huh?

100
00:07:31,030 --> 00:07:36,030
After lunch, I retreat to this lab covered in magic-resistant brick for summoning experiments.

101
00:07:37,030 --> 00:07:39,030
My part in this isn't too demanding.

102
00:07:39,030 --> 00:07:43,030
I just pour mana into magic circles that Nanahoshi devised herself.

103
00:07:45,030 --> 00:07:48,030
They say most proven summoning circles have been lost.

104
00:07:48,030 --> 00:07:54,030
But by studying the principles behind them, coupled with lots of experimentation with countless different circles,

105
00:07:54,030 --> 00:07:57,030
she's managed to invent a few of her own original spells.

106
00:07:58,030 --> 00:07:59,030
Gotta say, I'm very impressed.

107
00:08:07,030 --> 00:08:08,030
Was that a success?

108
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:09,030
Nope.

109
00:08:09,030 --> 00:08:10,030
Another dead.

110
00:08:11,030 --> 00:08:14,030
Now, with me here, she's taking the kitchen sink approach.

111
00:08:14,030 --> 00:08:16,030
We're testing more circles than I can count.

112
00:08:17,030 --> 00:08:22,030
So, hey, what is the end goal of this experiment, exactly?

113
00:08:22,030 --> 00:08:25,030
Eventually, I want to summon a person from our world.

114
00:08:26,030 --> 00:08:30,030
But in the short term, I'm just trying to work out the major principles on a much smaller scale.

115
00:08:31,030 --> 00:08:32,030
It shouldn't be possible.

116
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:38,030
But if she can draw a circle that summons a person, she should be able to draw one that sends them back as well.

117
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:40,030
That's the hope, anyway.

118
00:08:43,030 --> 00:08:44,030
Let me ask you something.

119
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:46,030
Say you do make that happen.

120
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:49,030
Besides getting home, won't that cause another big mana disaster?

121
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:52,030
I'm planning to avoid that, of course.

122
00:08:53,030 --> 00:08:57,030
If I can prove a few more theorems, I can form a hypothesis as to why it happened in the first place,

123
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:59,030
and how to keep it from happening again.

124
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:06,030
Well, they say that failure is part of experimentation, so please don't take the risk too lightly, okay?

125
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:08,030
Obviously.

126
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:10,030
Why do you think I'm starting with the basics?

127
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:16,030
You know, I would love to learn about summoning magic myself.

128
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:19,030
You must understand, this knowledge is my lifeline.

129
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:21,030
I need to be careful about sharing it.

130
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:24,030
Yeah, but part of this arrangement was that you would share it.

131
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:28,030
Okay, fine. I'll tell you one thing after this experiment, promise.

132
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:32,030
Only one? Doesn't seem worth it to me.

133
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:38,030
Well, think of it this way. As soon as my research is done and I've gone home, you get access to all my writing.

134
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:41,030
I'm sure you can be patient in the meantime.

135
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:46,030
I guess begging before we actually get anything done would be pretty pathetic.

136
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:50,030
If you want to know that badly, do some research of your own.

137
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:52,030
Thanks, I appreciate it.

138
00:09:52,030 --> 00:09:58,030
After dinner, I give Julie magic lessons.

139
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:11,030
And then on to figure making. This is still Julie's first year, so her mana capacity is fairly low and I wouldn't say she has much finesse.

140
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:18,030
I mean, she is good with her hands. But she's only just started using sculpting tools so her skills aren't honed yet.

141
00:10:19,030 --> 00:10:20,030
Look at this side of the face.

142
00:10:20,030 --> 00:10:22,030
We've got to think in the long term.

143
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:33,030
Since I met Nana Hoshi, I haven't been to the library nearly as much.

144
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:39,030
And that's how my days go by.

145
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:42,030
Still no lead on a cure though.

146
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:48,030
I haven't seen much of Master Fitz lately either.

147
00:10:48,030 --> 00:10:54,030
Then one day I received a letter.

148
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:00,030
It says it's from Soldot.

149
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:06,030
Soldot Heckler. Head honcho of Step Leader. Blast from the past.

150
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:15,030
Okay, so he's in Sharia for a big guild meetup and he wants to grab a bite to eat for old times sake. Catch up a bit.

151
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:26,030
I wonder if this is what it feels like to reconnect with your old high school buddies or something.

152
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:28,030
Gotta say, it ain't bad.

153
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:33,030
How you doing, Quagmire? I haven't seen you in ages, man.

154
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:36,030
Yeah, it almost feels like a whole lifetime ago.

155
00:11:37,030 --> 00:11:40,030
You gotta get rid of the baby clothes. You look like a run-of-the-mill rookie in that get-up.

156
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:45,030
Maybe I miss those days and I want to go back. Give me your bag. Let me carry it somewhere.

157
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:50,030
You carrying our bags? Are you nuts? We ought to be carrying yours.

158
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:53,030
You did after that stray dragon fight. We're good.

159
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:55,030
Man, we made out like bandits on that one.

160
00:11:56,030 --> 00:11:58,030
Anyway, what's up with you, Alphiers?

161
00:11:59,030 --> 00:12:02,030
What's a mega-slut like you doing with a boyfriend? Is this a joke or something?

162
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:07,030
No, merely proof that no man I've ever met has truly won my heart before.

163
00:12:08,030 --> 00:12:14,030
But now, I found the man of my dreams and I couldn't be happier.

164
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:18,030
You may find it hard to believe, but I can be quite devoted.

165
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:23,030
No way that's how they met.

166
00:12:23,030 --> 00:12:25,030
Hey, Sol. Inter-party meeting.

167
00:12:26,030 --> 00:12:29,030
Another? Are you kidding me? We talked all morning, didn't we?

168
00:12:30,030 --> 00:12:33,030
What do you expect? The whole clan's fired up. Might as well get it out of the way.

169
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:38,030
And here I thought I would kind of enjoy myself this afternoon.

170
00:12:39,030 --> 00:12:42,030
Sorry, Quagmire. I gotta run. But let's do this again, alright?

171
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:45,030
Yeah. Just let me know when you're in town.

172
00:12:53,030 --> 00:12:56,030
So, what now? You two have anything planned for the rest of the day?

173
00:12:57,030 --> 00:13:03,030
Not really, no. But actually, we were talking about giving Cliff a crash course in adventuring.

174
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:05,030
If you would care to join us?

175
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:10,030
Uh... You needn't come. I don't intend to rely on your help.

176
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:13,030
In that case, I'll just head on back to school.

177
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:17,030
Then do take care going back and please give everyone our best.

178
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:21,030
And I know you know this, but please remember that you have a beginner with you,

179
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:23,030
so don't go anywhere too dangerous. Cool?

180
00:13:24,030 --> 00:13:25,030
Sure thing.

181
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:27,030
Excuse me?

182
00:13:28,030 --> 00:13:32,030
Yes, Rudeus, we'll be careful. No challenging dragons or demon kings.

183
00:13:51,030 --> 00:13:52,030
Hey.

184
00:13:58,030 --> 00:14:02,030
Should the two of them be out here? Who's guarding the princess?

185
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:05,030
Well, I better at least say hi.

186
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:10,030
Hey, you two. Fancy meeting you all the way out here.

187
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:13,030
Who do you... Oh great, it's you.

188
00:14:13,030 --> 00:14:19,030
Sounds like he still doesn't like me very much. But as long as I can stay friends with Master Fitz, who cares.

189
00:14:20,030 --> 00:14:25,030
What's up? You okay, Master Fitz? There's something different about you today.

190
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:30,030
I can't put my finger on it. The way he carries himself.

191
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:34,030
What do you need? Speak your piece and move along, would you?

192
00:14:35,030 --> 00:14:36,030
Did I catch them at a bad time?

193
00:14:37,030 --> 00:14:39,030
Don't tell me. Are they on a date?

194
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:40,030
Are they on a date?

195
00:14:40,030 --> 00:14:46,030
Yeah, maybe Luke swings both ways, and he and Fitz have a sparring practice.

196
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:50,030
I just happened to see you, so I thought I would say hello.

197
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:53,030
Um, Master Fitz?

198
00:14:53,030 --> 00:15:06,030
I see. We appreciate the greeting. I have to remind you, however, that Fitz isn't permitted to speak while guarding Her Highness. Apologies. I'm sure you understand.

199
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:13,030
I guess I really did come at a bad time. Still, it seems harsh for him to ignore me completely like this.

200
00:15:18,030 --> 00:15:19,030
What is it?

201
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:23,030
Oh, it's nothing. Um, excuse me.

202
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:33,030
I don't think I'd let anything show on the outside, but man, that really stung.

203
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:39,030
Why would he shun me like that? It hurts so much I can hardly even think straight.

204
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:53,030
I've been mulling it over, but I still can't figure out why Master Fitz was avoiding me just now.

205
00:15:53,030 --> 00:16:07,030
I don't remember doing anything to offend him. I just want to talk about my feelings with someone. Well, no, I just want to gripe. I'm pretty sure Xanobah is at the Mages Guild right now for some blessed child research.

206
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:23,030
He probably took Julie with him. Now, Linia and Persina would be terrible listeners. Probably make fun of me. And Nanahoshi kind of has her hands full. She won't want to listen to my problems.

207
00:16:23,030 --> 00:16:35,030
Okay, whatever. Might as well go to the library.

208
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:37,030
Might as well go to the library.

209
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:45,030
Oh, hey.

210
00:16:45,030 --> 00:16:49,030
Hey, Rudeus. Been a little while, hasn't it?

211
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:52,030
He's just his normal self.

212
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:55,030
Is there a problem? Do I have something on my face?

213
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:59,030
Why did you ignore me in the market earlier today?

214
00:17:01,030 --> 00:17:07,030
I'm sorry, but it really is true that I'm not allowed to speak while I'm on duty, you know? Silent fits.

215
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:17,030
People don't take me seriously because of my voice. It's childish. So in public, I'm not supposed to speak, especially around Princess Ariel.

216
00:17:18,030 --> 00:17:21,030
Okay, but I didn't see the princess anywhere around you.

217
00:17:22,030 --> 00:17:26,030
She was in a shop nearby. We aren't her only protection.

218
00:17:29,030 --> 00:17:33,030
Forgive me for demanding your attention, then. Poor timing, I guess.

219
00:17:33,030 --> 00:17:38,030
Mm-mm. It's alright. I feel bad that I couldn't respond to you, though.

220
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:42,030
Okay, I think I see what's happening here.

221
00:17:43,030 --> 00:17:49,030
I'm not positive, but I think Princess Ariel has actually been disguising herself as Master Fitz somehow.

222
00:17:50,030 --> 00:17:54,030
So she was trying to avoid me earlier because any careless chitchat could blow her cover.

223
00:17:55,030 --> 00:17:57,030
The more I think about it, the more sense it makes overall.

224
00:17:57,030 --> 00:18:05,030
But either way, there's still no evidence that Fitz is mad at me. And that's all I really care about. So, good.

225
00:18:06,030 --> 00:18:11,030
Well, that's a relief. I was starting to worry that you suddenly started hating me or something.

226
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:15,030
No, of course not. How could I ever hate you?

227
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:43,030
Every little thing he does sticks with me. The way he scratches behind his ears. The way he stretches when he finishes a study session. The way he smells when he brushes close by me.

228
00:18:43,030 --> 00:18:50,030
And then there's that smile. I can't get that bashful smile out of my head.

229
00:18:50,030 --> 00:19:05,030
I know what all this means, of course.

230
00:19:05,030 --> 00:19:10,030
I'm in love.

231
00:19:10,030 --> 00:19:14,030
I'm in love with a man. Assuming he really is one, which... Hmm.

232
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:15,030
Professor Genus?

233
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:17,030
Well, hello, Rudeus. What brings you to see me today?

234
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:21,030
Well, I want to ask about Master Fitz.

235
00:19:21,030 --> 00:19:28,030
Then you'll have to forgive me. The staff have been given rather strict instructions regarding him and his employer.

236
00:19:28,030 --> 00:19:35,030
I see, of course. Could you confirm basic information for me, like his sex?

237
00:19:35,030 --> 00:19:42,030
Like his sex? Well, yes. Hmm.

238
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:44,030
